{"id":"kompas","lemma":"компас","pos":"noun","rank":4939,"glosses":["compass"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/44/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-DomesticFrog-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81.wav/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-DomesticFrog-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81.wav.mp3","forms":{"genitive":"компаса","plural":"компасы"},"examples":[{"text":"Где компас?","en":"Where's the compass?","words":[{"g":"where"},null]},{"text":"Возьми с собой компас.","en":"Bring your compass along.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},{"g":"with / from"},null,null]},{"text":"Том посмотрел на свой компас.","en":"Tom looked at his compass.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"one's own"},null]},{"text":"Общество без религии, как судно без компаса.","en":"A society without religion is like a ship without a compass.","words":[{"g":"society, public"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"religion","l":"религия"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"ship, vessel"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Этот компас вам пригодится в дороге.","en":"This compass will be useful on your trip.","words":[{"g":"this/that one"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"to come in handy","l":"пригодиться"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}